give @s written_book{title:"Culling",author:"lollip0529",pages:['["", {"text": "Culling\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "Why the portal room\'s spawner doesn\'t spike in the pie from the scan spot.\\n\\nSodium only draws what its search reaches through air, one 16x16x16 subchunk at a time.\\n\\nby lollip0529"]','["", {"text": "Spike (not culled)", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nNothing culls it. The spawner draws, so it spikes in the pie from the scan spot."]','["", {"text": "Too far (64+)", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nBlock entities only draw within 64 blocks of your eyes. The spawner is farther, so it can\'t spike until you get closer."]','["", {"text": "Directionality", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nThe search visits each subchunk once, from whichever side it gets there first. A nearer path takes a subchunk on the way and leads nowhere, so the side the real way in needs is never tried."]','["", {"text": "Vertical culling", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nThe search never turns back: once it steps down a subchunk it can\'t step up again, and the other way round. The way in crosses a layer line (y a multiple of 16) and has to come back, so it\'s cut off. Another layer can spike."]','["", {"text": "Horizontal culling", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nSame rule sideways: once the search steps east it can\'t step west, and likewise north and south. The way in doubles back across a chunk line, so it\'s cut off. Another chunk can spike."]','["", {"text": "Lack of air", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nA subchunk only passes the search on between faces its air links. Even with the turn-back rules lifted, no chain of linked air reaches the portal room."]','["", {"text": "Flush hidden", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nNo air links your eyes to the spawner; the way in is walled off flush. Culling follows air, so the spawner stays hidden until you break through."]','["", {"text": "Chunk border", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nCulled where you stand, but a step into the next chunk on your layer starts the search from another subchunk, and from there it spikes."]','["", {"text": "Angle (EyeZoom too narrow)", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nThe search only goes through subchunks inside your view. EyeZoom is so narrow that no way in fits at any yaw, though Thin or a wider view shows the spike."]','["", {"text": "Ghost spike", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nIt spikes, but only facing more than 90 degrees away from the portal room: leaving subchunks out of view can open a route the full view misses. Don\'t trust its direction; check from a second spot."]']}
